<title>USA: Calif. Health Facilities Authority $34 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Calif. Health Facilities Authority $34 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Thursday</p>
<p>it tentatively priced $34 million of California Health</p>
<p>Facilities Financing Authority insured revenue bonds, 1996</p>
<p>Series E, for Catholic Healthcare West, with a top yield of</p>
<p>5.65 percent in 2023.</p>
<p>The bonds are AMBAC insured.</p>
<p>CALIFORNIA HEALTH FACILITIES FINANCING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $34,150,000*</p>
<p>INSURED REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(CATHOLIC HEALTHCARE WEST)</p>
<p>1996 SERIES E</p>
<p>THIS IS A PRELIMINARY PRICING.</p>
